---
import DocsLayout from "../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Examples | DP-LMI Package">
  <section class="hero compact">
    <h1>Examples</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Short workflows that mirror the manual and current tests. Outputs are
      transcript-style when the result is stable.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Known-Data Algebra</h2>
    <pre><code>{`A = dpmat({[0 1]}, {1, 2}, Degree=1);
B = dpmat({[0 1]}, {10, 20}, Degree=1);
C = A * B;
C.Degree

ans =

     2`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Decision Expression Assembly</h2>
    <pre><code>{`P = dpvar(2, {[0 1]}, "symmetric");
Cpos = P >= 0;
numel(Cpos.Constraints)

ans =

     2`}</code></pre>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Rate-Weighted Derivative</h2>
    <pre><code>{`P = dpvar(1, {[0 2]}, RateBounds=[-2 3]);
dP = rhodiff(P);
size(dP.LocalValues{1})

ans =

     2     1`}</code></pre>
    <p>
      The two rows correspond to the lower and upper admissible scalar rate
      vertices. Tensor grids enumerate tensor-product rate vertices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Solver Handoff</h2>
    <pre><code>{`if exist("mosekopt", "file") ~= 0
    opts = sdpsettings("solver", "mosek", "verbose", 0);
else
    opts = sdpsettings("solver", "lmilab", "verbose", 0);
end
sol = optimize(Cpos.toYalmip, [], opts);`}</code></pre>
  </section>
</DocsLayout>
